- **`test/plist_test.c`, `test/plist_btest.c`, `test/plist_jtest.c`, `test/plist_otest.c`, `test/plist_cmp.c`**: These files are test cases for the `plist` library. They read input files and perform conversions or comparisons, but they are primarily used for testing rather than production use.
